---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
import Button from "../components/Button.astro";
import H1 from "../components/text/H1.astro";
import H2 from "../components/text/H2.astro";
import H3 from "../components/text/H3.astro";
import Text from "../components/text/Text.astro";


const headContent ={
  metaTitle: "Our Process | The formula we use to build custom websites",
  metaDescription: "We have a 4-step formula to create high-performing websites for small businesses, websites that actually bring you more clients.",
}

---

<MainLayout headContent={headContent}>
  <section class="flex justify-center bg-blue-gradient px-32 md:px-53 lg:px-59 py-85 md:py-223 lg:py-249">
    <div class="grow-1 flex flex-col gap-20 lg:gap-22 max-w-1281">
      <H1 class="max-w-350 md:max-w-400 lg:max-w-580">Our Process for Designing a Custom Website</H1>
      <Text class="text-parchment max-w-440 md:max-w-530 lg:max-w-600">
        We use a formula to create high-performing business websites.
        See what happens when we work with you. 
      </Text>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="flex justify-center px-32 md:px-53 lg:px-59 py-53 md:py-95">
    <div class="grow-1 flex flex-col items-center gap-53 md:gap-59 max-w-1032">
      <H2>Here is the situation for most websites</H2>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-36">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-22">
          <H3>When people visit your website</H3>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-14">
            <div class="flex gap-18 ps-5 md:ps-8">
              <div class="w-24">
                <p class="text-spark text-27 font-semibold">1.</p>
              </div>
              <Text>They look for answers to their questions about you and your services.</Text>
            </div>
            <div class="flex gap-18 ps-5 md:ps-8">
              <div class="w-24">
                <p class="text-spark text-27 font-semibold">2.</p>
              </div>
              <Text>They get a feel of your business and make judgments about the trustworthiness of your business.</Text>
            </div>
            <div class="flex gap-18 ps-5 md:ps-8">
              <div class="w-24">
                <p class="text-spark text-27 font-semibold">3.</p>
              </div>
              <Text>Based on what they feel about your business and your services, they will choose between you and a competitor.</Text>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-22">
          <H3>When a website doesn’t do its job</H3>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-14">
            <div class="flex gap-18 ps-5 md:ps-8">
              <div class="w-24">
                <p class="text-spark text-27 font-semibold">1.</p>
              </div>
              <Text>Visitors can’t find the right information and are confused about what services you provide.</Text>
            </div>
            <div class="flex gap-18 ps-5 md:ps-8">
              <div class="w-24">
                <p class="text-spark text-27 font-semibold">2.</p>
              </div>
              <Text>People don’t understand the value of your services clearly and don’t know why they should choose you.</Text>
            </div>
            <div class="flex gap-18 ps-5 md:ps-8">
              <div class="w-24">
                <p class="text-spark text-27 font-semibold">3.</p>
              </div>
              <Text>Visitors get a bad first impression of your business because of your website and don’t feel like they can trust you.</Text>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <p class="text-23/[150%] md:text-28/[150%] lg:text-36/[150%] italic">How do you fix this?</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="flex flex-col items-center bg-charcoal px-32 md:px-59 py-53 lg:py-95 gap-36">
    <H2 color="electric text-center">The formula for a perfect website</H2>
    <Text class="text-parchment">A professional website, one that turns visitors in clients, is created by focusing on these four things:</Text>
    <div class="grow-1 flex flex-col items-center md:items-start justify-center md:flex-row gap-59 max-w-559 md:max-w-630 lg:max-w-1281 lg:w-full">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-36 lg:gap-0 lg:w-full">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center md:items-start gap-28 py-20 md:py-36 md:px-36 lg:w-630">
          <img class="w-52 lg:w-72 pt-8" src="/icons/big-number-one-electric.svg" alt="Number one" width="72" height="84"/>
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center md:items-start gap-9">
            <H3 color='electric'>Content</H3> 
            <Text class="text-parchment">
              Good copy convinces. The right photos engage. 
              Using effective button text makes people more likely to take action. 
            </Text>
            <Text class="text-parchment">
              Your website content is the #1 important thing to get right. 
              Without it, visitors leave your website unconvinced.
            </Text>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="lg:self-end flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center md:items-start gap-28 py-20 md:py-36 md:px-36 lg:w-630 lg:-mt-10 xl:-mt-70">
          <img class="w-52 lg:w-72 pt-8" src="/icons/big-number-two-electric.svg" alt="Number two" width="72" height="84"/>
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center md:items-start gap-9">
            <H3 color='electric'>Mobile-friendliness</H3> 
            <Text class="text-parchment">
              Roughly 50% of website visitors use their phones. 
              These visitors expect your website work perfectly on their device. 
              If not, they are very likely to go somewhere else. 
            </Text>
            <Text class="text-parchment">
              Having a non-mobile-friendly website gives them a negative impression of your business.
            </Text>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center md:items-start gap-28 py-20 md:py-36 md:px-36 lg:w-630 lg:-mt-10 xl:-mt-70">
          <img class="w-52 lg:w-72 pt-8" src="/icons/big-number-three-electric.svg" alt="Number three" width="72" height="84"/>
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center md:items-start gap-9">
            <H3 color='electric'>Fast load speeds</H3> 
            <Text class="text-parchment">
              People will leave your website if it loads too slowly. 
              It annoys them. They lose patience. 
            </Text>
            <Text class="text-parchment">
              On the other hand, if your website is faster than average, it shows that it is <i>high-quality</i>. 
              And people will notice and think well of your business.
            </Text>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="lg:self-end flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center md:items-start gap-28 py-20 md:py-36 md:px-36 lg:w-630 lg:-mt-10 xl:-mt-70">
          <img class="w-52 lg:w-72 pt-8" src="/icons/big-number-four-electric.svg" alt="Number four" width="72" height="84"/>
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center md:items-start gap-9">
            <H3 color='electric'>Captivating design</H3> 
            <Text class="text-parchment">
              Your website’s design is the first thing that visitors notice. 
              It either captivates them or pushes them away.  
            </Text>
            <Text class="text-parchment">
              The design is a reflection of your business. 
              When the design is good, you become more trustable.
            </Text>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="flex flex-col items-center px-32 md:px-53 lg:px-95 py-59 gap-53 md:gap-59">
    <H2 class="text-center">Our website-building process</H2>
    <div class="relative grow-1 flex flex-col gap-53 md:gap-95 md:py-36 max-w-559 md:max-w-750 lg:max-w-960 xl:max-w-1145">
      <div class='game-plan-line absolute -z-1 w-3 md:w-5 bg-spark translate-x-[1.59375rem] md:translate-x-[2.5625rem] lg:translate-x-[2.96875rem]'></div>
      <div class="flex flex-row gap-20 md:gap-59">
        <div class="shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center h-54 md:h-87 lg:h-100 w-54 md:w-87 lg:w-100 border-3 md:border-5 border-spark rounded-full bg-parchment">
          <p class="number-in-circle text-21 md:text-40/[150%] lg:text-61/[150%] font-semibold text-spark">1</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-5">
          <H3>We plan</H3>
          <Text>
            We start with meeting together to get a plan for your website. 
            We get in agreement about the direction of the website. 
            Once we understand your goals, we can work to achieve the exact results you are looking for.
          </Text>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-row gap-20 md:gap-59">
        <div class="shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center h-54 md:h-87 lg:h-100 w-54 md:w-87 lg:w-100 border-3 md:border-5 border-spark rounded-full bg-parchment">
          <p class="number-in-circle text-21 md:text-40/[150%] lg:text-61/[150%] font-semibold text-spark">2</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-5">
          <H3>We build</H3>
          <Text>
            Using our 4-step formula, we create you a high-performing website. 
            We start by designing a prototype of your website. 
            Then we use this prototype to build your website with custom code.
          </Text>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-row gap-20 md:gap-59 bg-parchment">
        <div class="shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center h-54 md:h-87 lg:h-100 w-54 md:w-87 lg:w-100 border-3 md:border-5 border-spark rounded-full">
          <p class="number-in-circle text-21 md:text-40/[150%] lg:text-61/[150%] font-semibold text-spark">3</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-5">
          <H3>You get results</H3>
          <Text>
            Now your website is complete! People who visit your website are now much more likely to 
            choose you over your competitors. 
            Now you can be proud of the website you have.
          </Text>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <Button class="self-center" link="/project-planning-call/" data-umami-event="middle-section-btn-2">Get started</Button>
  </section>
  <section class="flex justify-center bg-blue py-59 px-32 md:px-95">
    <div class="grow-1 flex flex-col md:flex-row-reverse md:flex-wrap justify-between justify-center items-center md:items-start gap-59 max-w-559 md:max-w-1281">
      <img 
        class="rounded-md" 
        src="/images/headshot-2-owner-jakin-stahl-480x600.webp" 
        alt="Headshot of the owner Jakin Stahl" 
        width="240" 
        height="300" 
        loading="lazy"
      >
      <div class="md:w-360 grow-1 shrink-0 flex flex-col items-center md:items-start gap-36">
        <H2 color="parchment">Get started with a custom website</H2>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-14 max-w-640">
          <Text class="text-parchment">
            The first step is to schedule a call with Jakin, the owner. On this call, we can answer any questions you may have.
          </Text>
          <Text class="text-parchment">
            We want to understand your business better and see if getting a custom website is right for you.
          </Text>
        </div>
        <Button class="self-center md:self-start" link="/project-planning-call/" data-umami-event="middle-section-btn-2">Book a call</Button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>

<style>
  @media screen and (width < 46.875rem) {
    .game-plan-line {
      height: 90%;
    }
  }
  @media screen and (min-width: 46.875rem) {
    .game-plan-line {
      height: calc(90% - 4.5rem);
    }
  }
  .number-in-circle {
    text-box-trim: trim-both;
    text-box-edge: cap alphabetic;
  }
</style>